---
import AboutHeroImage from "../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg";
import Layout from "../layouts/BlogPost.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet"
  pubDate={new Date("October 14 2026")}
>
  <p>
    This website is a statically generated site hosted on GitHub Pages. It has the following
    characteristics:
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>No user accounts:</strong> There is no option to sign up, log in, or create a
        profile. We do not collect personal information such as your name, email address, or
        physical address.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>No database:</strong> All website content is stored in static files within our
        open-source GitHub repository.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>No tracking cookies:</strong> We do not use tracking cookies or advertisement of any
        kind.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </p>

  <h4>Hosting and Server Logs</h4>

  <p>
    This website is hosted on GitHub Pages. As part of its standard hosting operations, GitHub may
    collect technical information, such as your IP address, in its server logs. This is governed by{" "}
    <a
      href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener"
    >
      GitHub's Privacy Statement
    </a>
    .
  </p>

  <h4>External Links</h4>

  <p>
    Our website may contain links to third-party websites, including plan provider websites, GitHub
    repositories, and tool documentation. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of these
    external sites. We recommend reviewing their respective privacy policies before visiting them.
  </p>

  <h4>Changes to This Policy</h4>

  <p>
    We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Since our website is open source, you can
    review the repository's history to track changes to this policy.
  </p>

  <h4>Contact</h4>

  <p>
    If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, please open a GitHub Issue in
    our repository.
  </p>
</Layout>
